<task id="035" project="spaarkeai-mcp-bff-api-r2">
  <metadata>
    <title>Search results widget (ui://spaarke/search-results.html)</title>
    <phase>2 Long-running work, AI, widgets, task writes</phase>
    <gate>r1 gate RELEASED 2026-11-25 (joint mcp-r1/mcp-r2 determination under the owner's delegation; see notes/decisions.md D-r1-gate). Before starting, merge origin/master into this branch (merge, never rebase). Do not edit r1's ISS-010 files (DecisionCommitService, Actions/DecisionActionExecutors, RecordCreationService, CallerWriteAuthorization, CallerRecordAccessProbe, CallerMetadataReadMemo, AssignTaskNotifier, the email-bell job handler) or the Decision wizard heading files (DecisionWizard/steps/FoundStep.tsx, Worklist/IssueLine.tsx, composeIssueLine.ts) without messaging mcp-r1 first.</gate>
    <status>not-started</status>
    <rigor>FULL</rigor>
    <rigor-reason>New widget resource, embed and CI changes, React widget over a shared component</rigor-reason>
    <model-tier>sonnet</model-tier>
    <model-tier-reason>Second widget on the scaffold 034 establishes; SearchResultsWidget is props-only</model-tier-reason>
    <effort>high</effort>
    <parallel-group>I</parallel-group>
    <parallel-safe>true</parallel-safe>
    <parallel-reason>Serialised after 034 (shared McpModule.cs, csproj, publish-bff-artifact.yml); runs beside 032 and 036</parallel-reason>
    <deps>021, 022, 034</deps>
    <tags>bff-api, react, typescript, frontend, fluent-ui</tags>
    <estimated-effort>5-6 hours</estimated-effort>
  </metadata>

  <prompt>Add a single-file widget src/client/widgets/spaarke-search-results/ that renders SearchResultsWidget (Spaarke.AI.Widgets, props only) from spaarke_search_documents / spaarke_find_records results over task 021's shared transport, served as ui://spaarke/search-results.html through McpModule with an empty CSP, embedded and verified by the publish workflow; point task 022's two tools at it with _meta.ui.resourceUri.</prompt>
  <role>SPAARKE platform developer. Follow ADRs strictly. Expert in MCP Apps widgets and Fluent v9.</role>
  <goal>Search results render in a widget in Chat and Cowork in light and dark; opening a hit uses the host's open-link; the Console's SearchResultsWidget tests pass unchanged; bundle &lt; 1 MB target, ≤ 3 MB hard.</goal>

  <context>
    <background>Spec FR-16, NFR-03, NFR-09. Component: src/client/shared/Spaarke.AI.Widgets/src/outputs/output-widgets/SearchResultsWidget.tsx (props only, per notes/reuse-scan.md). Scaffold and resource pattern from task 034 (spaarke-briefing, BriefingWidgetResource) and r1's spaarke-decisions. Tools from task 022 return the full hit payload in structuredContent.</background>
    <relevant-files>
      <file role="new">src/server/api/Sprk.Bff.Api/Api/Mcp/LegalOperations/Search/SearchResultsWidgetResource.cs</file>
      <file role="modify">src/server/api/Sprk.Bff.Api/Api/Mcp/LegalOperations/Search/SearchDocumentsTool.cs, FindRecordsTool.cs (_meta.ui.resourceUri only)</file>
      <file role="modify">src/server/api/Sprk.Bff.Api/Infrastructure/DI/McpModule.cs</file>
      <file role="modify">src/server/api/Sprk.Bff.Api/Sprk.Bff.Api.csproj</file>
      <file role="modify">.github/workflows/publish-bff-artifact.yml</file>
      <file role="new">src/client/widgets/spaarke-search-results/** (scaffold copied from spaarke-briefing)</file>
      <file role="new">src/client/widgets/spaarke-search-results/src/__tests__/App.test.tsx</file>
      <file role="new">tests/integration/contract/Api/Mcp/Search/SearchResultsWidgetResourceTests.cs</file>
      <file role="canonical-reference">src/client/shared/Spaarke.AI.Widgets/src/outputs/output-widgets/SearchResultsWidget.tsx</file>
      <file role="canonical-reference">src/client/widgets/spaarke-briefing/ (task 034)</file>
      <file role="canonical-reference">src/server/api/Sprk.Bff.Api/Api/Mcp/LegalOperations/Briefing/BriefingWidgetResource.cs (task 034)</file>
    </relevant-files>
    <dependencies>
      <dependency task="021" status="pending">Shared widget transport</dependency>
      <dependency task="022" status="pending">Search tools</dependency>
      <dependency task="034" status="pending">Widget scaffold and shared-file ordering</dependency>
    </dependencies>
  </context>

  <constraints>
    <constraint source="project">r1 gate RELEASED 2026-11-25 (joint mcp-r1/mcp-r2 determination under the owner's delegation; see notes/decisions.md D-r1-gate). Before starting, merge origin/master into this branch (merge, never rebase). Do not edit r1's ISS-010 files (DecisionCommitService, Actions/DecisionActionExecutors, RecordCreationService, CallerWriteAuthorization, CallerRecordAccessProbe, CallerMetadataReadMemo, AssignTaskNotifier, the email-bell job handler) or the Decision wizard heading files (DecisionWizard/steps/FoundStep.tsx, Worklist/IssueLine.tsx, composeIssueLine.ts) without messaging mcp-r1 first.</constraint>
    <constraint source="project">Widget: SearchResultsWidget used as-is through props (no edit to Spaarke.AI.Widgets); transport from src/client/widgets/shared/mcp/; _meta.ui.csp empty; no fetch, MSAL or Xrm; open-in-Spaarke links go through the host's openLink; Fluent v9 semantic tokens; host light/dark; keyboard operable. Bundle &lt; 1 MB target, 3 MB hard ceiling.</constraint>
    <constraint source="project">022's tools change only by adding _meta.ui.resourceUri; their model-visible text and structuredContent stay as 022 left them (022's contract tests pass unchanged). Mcp:Enabled=false removes the resource (ADR-032).</constraint>
    <constraint source="ADR-012">If SearchResultsWidget needs a prop change to work outside the Console, STOP and escalate instead of editing the shared component.</constraint>
    <constraint source="ADR-029">Every change this task makes under src/server/api/Sprk.Bff.Api/ is listed in the PR with a Placement Justification that cites .claude/constraints/bff-extensions.md (source: spec.md 'Placement &amp; New Components'), and the PR records the publish-size delta against a fresh master build per .claude/constraints/azure-deployment.md 'BFF Publish-Size Per-Task Verification Rule': +5 MB or more needs explicit justification, 55 MB total triggers architecture review, 60 MB is a hard stop. No new HIGH CVE (dotnet list package --vulnerable --include-transitive).</constraint>
    <constraint source="ADR-038">Every test this task adds lives on a KEEP path (tests/integration/{auth,contract,regression,data-mutation}/** or tests/unit/domain/**, or the widget's own jest suite), mocks only at module boundaries, and uses no Mock&lt;HttpMessageHandler&gt; or Mock&lt;IServiceClient&gt;.</constraint>
    <constraint source="project">Node install: npm install --legacy-peer-deps --no-audit --no-fund (not npm ci). Before each push run bash scripts/quality/check-changed-cs-format.sh origin/master.</constraint>
  </constraints>

